Subject: SOP Multi-Target Semantic Compiler Static Semantics and Target ABI

Description: WS-CTPR-003 worker proof defining the grammar boundary, ordered static-semantic passes, type and effect disciplines, module contract, optimization laws, common target ABI, diagnostics, compatibility behavior, and conformance obligations needed by the SOP multi-target language-purpose SJS.

